    "Id": "chassisdef_adder_ADR-W",
    "Name": "Adder",
    "Details": "A loadout mainly fielded by the Wolf's Dragoons. Two ER Large Lasers are the main damage dealers, while a C3 slave computer and a basic ECM suite provides some extra performance.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
